# Filesystem Watch Hook

# This hook provides the path to monitor for the FileSystemWatcher skill
# The path is injected at runtime to avoid any .env file access

# Example configuration
WATCH_PATH="/path/to/monitor"

# Instructions for users:
# 1. Replace /path/to/monitor with the actual path to watch
# 2. Ensure the path exists and has appropriate read permissions
# 3. Restart the AI Employee system after updating this hook